     "text": "## Task Complete\n\n**What I created and drew:**\n- Alignment: **MAIN-ST**\n- Start point: N 5000.00, E 2000.00 ([2000, 5000] in RoadDraft coordinates)\n- End point: [3200, 5000] (1,200 ft due east)\n- Begin station: 10+00 / End station: 22+00\n- Centerline: Entity **LN-001** on layer **align_MAIN**\n- Bearing: N 90°00'00\" E (perfectly due east)\n- Length: 1,200.00 ft (confirmed)\n\n**Tool calls in order:**\n1. **create_alignment** – name: \"MAIN-ST\", begin_station: \"10+00\", pis: [[2000, 5000], [3200, 5000]]\n   - Result: 1 tangent element, 1200 ft, stations 10+00 to 22+00\n2. **draw_alignment** – alignment: \"MAIN-ST\", layer: \"align_MAIN\"\n   - Result: LN-001 created on align_MAIN\n\n**Errors/issues:** None. All requirements met exactly as specified."
